  "description": "<p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"569\">This <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"319\">bamboo basket</strong> is a beautiful blend of traditional craftsmanship and natural elegance, handwoven by skilled artisans in Vietnam. Made entirely from sustainably sourced bamboo, it offers a lightweight yet durable storage solution for home, office, or retail spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"813\">Ideal for organizing clothes, toys, towels, kitchen goods, or decorative display, this basket adds warmth and texture to any setting. With its versatile shape, natural tones, and smooth finish, it complements both rustic and modern interiors.</p>\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"988\">At <strong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"849\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we supply directly from our <strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"901\">factory in Vietnam</strong>, with <strong data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"933\">OEM/ODM customization</strong> and <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"959\">wholesale options</strong> available for global buyers.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"993\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1017\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1017\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1360\">\n<li data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1057\">\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1057\">100% natural and sustainable bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1106\">\n<p data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1106\">Handwoven by experienced Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1149\">\n<p data-start=\"1109\" data-end=\"1149\">Lightweight, sturdy, and biodegradable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1205\">\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1205\">Available in round, oval, square, and custom shapes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1252\">\n<p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1252\">Optional handles, lids, and fabric linings</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1315\">\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1315\">Multipurpose: storage, display, gift basket, or retail use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1360\">\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1360\">Eco-conscious and plastic-free alternative</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1365\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1394\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1392\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1422\">Each basket contributes to:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1758\">\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1485\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1485\"><strong data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1455\">Generating foreign income</strong> for Vietnam through exports</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1570\"><strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1529\">Supporting rural farmers and artisans</strong>, especially during non-harvest periods</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1631\">\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1631\"><strong data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1610\">Utilizing local natural materials</strong> and reducing waste</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1700\">\n<p data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1700\"><strong data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1666\">Preserving cultural heritage</strong> in Vietnamese handcraftsmanship</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1758\">\n<p data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1758\">Promoting <strong data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1758\">sustainable, ethical production practices</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1887\">As a certified <strong data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1824\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale exporter</strong>, we are proud to deliver high-quality bamboo crafts worldwide.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1892\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1928\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1926\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"2020\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1962\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1962\" data-end=\"1965\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1977\" data-end=\"2020\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
